03:02:18.490 --> 03:02:22.870
I, I, I've no reason for being nervous like this, but, but I've been working too hard.

03:02:24.240 --> 03:02:25.220
A terrific experiment.

03:02:26.320 --> 03:02:27.760
One that I wanted to surprise you with.

03:02:28.120 --> 03:02:29.700
One that would establish me and my...

03:02:30.190 --> 03:02:33.910
My work, my work, there's something outstanding in the world of science.

03:02:33.910 --> 03:02:37.110
But believe me, darling, believe me, there's nothing to be afraid of.

03:02:37.110 --> 03:02:42.480
I wouldn't be afraid if I hadn't, for the first time, sensed that you were afraid.

03:02:42.480 --> 03:02:46.960
Me? Oh, silly. Everything's under control.

03:02:46.960 --> 03:02:50.960
I'll not lose my temper again, you'll see.

03:03:00.540 --> 03:03:16.990
Oh, sorry young man, I shan't be able to take talking with you today.

03:03:16.990 --> 03:03:19.930
Tell your father and mother I'll be back very soon. Very soon.

03:03:19.930 --> 03:03:21.050
Goodbye, General.

03:03:21.050 --> 03:03:23.140
Grants, remain here on guard.

03:03:23.140 --> 03:03:27.270
Now I can go to the lab.

03:03:27.270 --> 03:03:29.670
I mean, I must go to the lab. Only for a minute, dear.

03:03:30.320 --> 03:03:32.240
I won't be long, really.

03:04:04.670 --> 03:04:10.610
Frankenstein, now touch him, or something happens to you worse than dying.

03:04:10.610 --> 03:04:12.490
How long has he been here?

03:04:12.490 --> 03:04:13.370
All night.

03:04:13.370 --> 03:04:14.370
You liar!

03:04:14.370 --> 03:04:15.300
He was in the village.

03:04:15.300 --> 03:04:16.950
You made him kill Herr Neumler.

03:04:16.950 --> 03:04:18.510
Yeah!

03:04:18.510 --> 03:04:19.980
Why not?

03:04:19.980 --> 03:04:21.880
Neumler kills me.

03:04:21.880 --> 03:04:30.000
Eight men say, Igor Heng, now eight men dead, all dead.

03:04:30.760 --> 03:04:32.930
crazy fool. If Croke finds him,

03:04:32.930 --> 03:04:35.170
he'll kill him. Then he won't be any good to either

03:04:35.170 --> 03:04:36.930
of us. You get out of here.

03:04:37.350 --> 03:04:39.010
If I find you hanging around here again,

03:04:39.090 --> 03:04:41.400
I'll... He's mine! He'll all belong

03:04:41.400 --> 03:04:43.590
to you! You go away!

03:04:43.930 --> 03:04:44.910
Not me!

03:04:44.910 --> 03:04:46.450
Arrgh!

03:05:07.130 --> 03:05:11.400
Barron's in the library, sir. The rest of the family are at dinner. Good. I've had to send

03:05:11.400 --> 03:05:15.770
the Bandelheim for additional police. Kranz, you report to Sergeant Schiller at the lower gate.

03:05:16.550 --> 03:05:30.000
The crowd's becoming unmanageable. Here, Inspector. Good evening, Inspector. I thought that I'd

03:05:30.090 --> 03:06:00.000
you sooner. Sorry I've been busy. Very busy indeed for me. My job is usually a rather sleepy one. Have a drink? Thank you, no. I should require all the wits I've got tonight. I've never seen you disturbed before, Inspector. You've even forgotten to take off your hat. Not forgotten here, Baron. Really a matter of form. My business tonight is official, not social. Rather a crude cut

03:06:00.030 --> 03:06:03.150
I agree, but the custom?

03:06:05.120 --> 03:06:07.370
Well, sir, what news from the front?

03:06:09.870 --> 03:06:12.600
Another death, another inquest.

03:06:14.490 --> 03:06:15.170
When did it occur?

03:06:15.600 --> 03:06:16.060
This afternoon?

03:06:16.760 --> 03:06:18.520
No, sometime last night.

03:06:19.790 --> 03:06:21.370
It was only discovered late this morning.

03:06:22.700 --> 03:06:28.810
Herr Lang, this time, the village apothecary, a very old and dear friend.

03:06:30.670 --> 03:06:31.670
He'll be mourned.

03:06:31.670 --> 03:06:34.580
Too bad.

03:06:34.580 --> 03:06:35.790
Yes.

03:06:35.790 --> 03:06:37.290
Isn't it?

03:06:37.290 --> 03:06:38.390
Hellang, eh?

03:06:38.390 --> 03:06:39.810
I've heard of him before.

03:06:39.810 --> 03:06:40.880
Oh, well.

03:06:40.880 --> 03:06:44.020
I suppose the villagers will say that I killed him just the same.

03:06:44.020 --> 03:06:45.020
No, not that you killed him.

03:06:45.020 --> 03:06:49.180
But that you know who did.

03:06:49.180 --> 03:06:51.970
Really?

03:06:51.970 --> 03:06:53.980
But of course I know who did.

03:06:53.980 --> 03:06:54.900
Haven't you heard?

03:06:54.900 --> 03:06:55.860
The monster!

03:06:56.760 --> 03:06:58.480
Yes.

03:06:58.480 --> 03:06:59.460
That's what they think.

03:06:59.460 --> 03:07:00.000
Is it the old monster?

03:07:00.000 --> 03:07:07.740
legendary monster of my father's time or am i supposed to have one up as a housewife whoops up

03:07:07.740 --> 03:07:15.920
an omelet i've been here over a month you know your wife and child are in danger so from what

03:07:15.920 --> 03:07:22.390
try to send them away there's unwell tomorrow in spite of you you forget i have my hat on

03:07:22.390 --> 03:07:30.000
meaning that i'm under arrest yes i promised you

03:07:30.090 --> 03:07:36.230
rest of the village is to keep them quiet. For the moment. Ah. For the murder of Langman,

03:07:36.230 --> 03:07:45.720
Neumoner? No. For the murder of Benson. A technical charge. For the time being. Why

03:07:45.720 --> 03:07:50.830
don't you search the laboratory? You have my permission. I've searched it already. Without

03:07:50.830 --> 03:07:58.830
your permission. With two men the other night. We found nothing incriminating but a very large table.

03:08:00.600 --> 03:08:03.680
- For a giant? - Yes.

03:08:04.000 --> 03:08:05.420
Yes, it was my father's.

03:08:05.560 --> 03:08:08.320
I reconstructed it out of curiosity.

03:08:08.400 --> 03:08:11.020
Why don't you search it again?

03:08:14.050 --> 03:08:18.470
Why, George, I think I know who your monster may be.

03:08:18.690 --> 03:08:21.050
- Good. - Who?

03:08:21.430 --> 03:08:22.770
Old Igor.

03:08:24.270 --> 03:08:25.390
Of course, why not?

03:08:26.970 --> 03:08:29.270
Everybody wants to hang old Igor again.

03:08:30.000 --> 03:08:34.970
has a perfect alibi. He was constantly under observation when every murder was committed.

03:08:36.350 --> 03:08:42.510
It's curious that the entire jury that hanged him is dead, but he was never seen at the

03:08:42.510 --> 03:08:50.290
scene of the crime. Yet it would be too simple to hang old Igor. Well, I don't trust him.

03:08:51.000 --> 03:08:57.020
I'm going to find him and kick him off the estate. With your permission.

03:09:00.280 --> 03:09:02.940
Yes, if you like.

03:11:32.140 --> 03:11:32.630
Oh

03:12:05.850 --> 03:12:07.590
Okay.

03:12:35.690 --> 03:12:39.320
Inspector, I'm more terrified every minute.

03:12:39.350 --> 03:12:43.670
Madam, I personally guarantee to get you and your son out of here in the morning.

03:12:43.670 --> 03:12:47.320
And Wolf, he's a bundle of uncontrollable nerves and...

03:12:47.420 --> 03:12:51.540
Yes, I'm going in now to comfort him.

03:12:51.890 --> 03:12:52.920
Thank you.

03:13:00.220 --> 03:13:03.650
- Come in, come in, come in.

03:13:03.650 --> 03:13:04.690
- Well, did you find Igor?

03:13:04.690 --> 03:13:05.860
- Yes, I got rid of him.

03:13:05.860 --> 03:13:06.700
Have a drink.

03:13:06.700 --> 03:13:08.640
- How did you get rid of him?

03:13:08.640 --> 03:13:09.500
- I killed him.

03:13:09.500 --> 03:13:11.820
He tried to murder me with his hammer, so I shot him.

03:13:11.820 --> 03:13:13.180
What are you gonna do about it?

03:13:13.180 --> 03:13:15.580
Compliment you, for it was he who undoubted

03:13:15.580 --> 03:13:19.200
he killed Benson.

03:13:19.200 --> 03:13:19.980
- Benson?

03:13:19.980 --> 03:13:22.910
- He's dead, murdered.

03:13:22.910 --> 03:13:24.790
I just found his body in a secret passageway

03:13:24.790 --> 03:13:26.810
off the nursery.

03:13:26.810 --> 03:13:28.770
Here's his watch.

03:13:28.770 --> 03:13:30.000
He was in the possession of your son.

03:13:31.530 --> 03:13:34.730
Here's a bit of chain that was attached to Vincent's vest.

03:13:36.200 --> 03:13:40.550
But Igor didn't do it, nor did you, nor was it done by any ghost.

03:13:40.900 --> 03:13:44.530
There's a monster of what new know it. He's in your control.

03:13:44.850 --> 03:13:47.980
By heaven, I think you're a worse fiend than your father.

03:13:48.210 --> 03:13:49.940
Where is this monster? Where is he?

03:13:50.200 --> 03:13:52.840
I'll stay by your side until you confess.

03:13:53.070 --> 03:13:56.080
And if you don't, I'll feed you to the villagers,

03:13:56.270 --> 03:13:59.350
like the Romans fed Christians to the lions.

03:14:00.730 --> 03:14:01.830
I wouldn't put it past you.

03:14:03.110 --> 03:14:04.790
In the meantime, will you have a drink?

03:14:05.560 --> 03:14:07.040
Or would you like to play darts?

03:17:41.320 --> 03:17:44.210
My lady! My lady!

03:17:46.210 --> 03:17:49.130
What is this?

03:17:49.130 --> 03:17:51.110
We just stop.

03:17:51.110 --> 03:17:53.320
Come on, let's have a drink.

03:17:53.320 --> 03:17:55.360
We just stop.

03:17:55.360 --> 03:17:56.810
Stop.

03:19:49.870 --> 03:19:55.370
to you the castle and the estates of Frankenstein. Do with them what you will, and may happiness

03:19:55.370 --> 03:19:58.800
and peace of mind be restored to you all.

03:20:00.060 --> 03:20:01.060
Bye.

03:20:01.060 --> 03:20:17.530
Bye.

03:20:17.530 --> 03:20:18.360
Bye, gentlemen.

03:20:18.360 --> 03:20:19.360
Goodbye.

03:20:19.360 --> 03:20:20.290
Bye, Peter.

03:21:04.800 --> 03:21:10.080
most abject apologies with that hot ending i should have told you to bring marshmallows and

03:21:10.080 --> 03:21:19.470
hot dogs for a weenie roast oh well maybe next time but next saturday night at 10 we won't have

