and beasts of unbelievable strength and power.

03:21:33.680 --> 03:21:38.560
Entire cities will be laid waste and all will be lost.

03:21:38.560 --> 03:21:42.440
And the three curvaceous ghoul beings

03:21:42.440 --> 03:21:46.820
and the giant Gamera can turn the tide.

03:21:46.820 --> 03:21:49.740
You won't want to miss this high-tech epic

03:21:49.740 --> 03:21:52.440
next Saturday night at 10:00.

03:21:52.440 --> 03:21:57.150
So do be sure to join me and Gamera,

03:21:57.150 --> 03:22:00.000
Super Monster.

03:22:00.000 --> 03:22:24.870
Ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho, ho.

03:27:14.170 --> 03:27:21.680
beast lives out of the raging storm in the dead of night the ravenous blood-sick

03:27:21.680 --> 03:27:30.000
creature searches for its sacrifice through the hideous darkness it lurches driven by death

03:27:30.440 --> 03:27:41.810
only the satisfaction of slaughter will cause it to return to the darkness from which it came.

03:30:22.910 --> 03:30:29.190
Hail our master, worship him, all ye gathered in his cathedral,

03:30:30.000 --> 03:30:40.510
down before the spirit of evil. He is a king, a lord of blackness. We sing his praises. We are the

03:30:40.510 --> 03:30:45.270
servants of evil. This is his service.

03:31:00.280 --> 03:31:01.800
BIRDS CHIRP

03:34:00.090 --> 03:34:00.640
Hmm.

03:34:51.850 --> 03:34:54.330
Some say that the creatures of evil

03:34:54.330 --> 03:34:56.370
are merely superstitions.

03:34:57.530 --> 03:35:00.000
Some say that the blackness of all

03:35:00.030 --> 03:35:08.860
graveyards comes from the night, and not from the unspeakable creatures which live therein.

03:35:08.860 --> 03:35:19.810
There are no werewolves, they say, and to prove it, a man will walk alone through an

03:35:19.810 --> 03:35:22.380
old graveyard tonight.

03:35:30.380 --> 03:35:38.840
- Mm-hmm.

03:36:01.470 --> 03:36:02.050
Thank you.
